msgid "Core Blueprint"
msgstr "Core Blueprint"

#: core-blueprint-profiles.php:91
msgid "Core Blueprint Base with API 1.0 or newer is required."
msgstr "Core Blueprint Base mit API 1.0 oder neuer ist erforderlich."

